{"title": "Unstable (Condition)", "pageid": 25437, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Unstable_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has stack type", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Generic Damage Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6c/Generic_Damage_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Unstable</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>The Gremishka is reacting to nearby magic and has become unstable. At the start of its next turn, it will trigger a random effect. </li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers -