_Icon.webp/38px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Dazes\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a2/Dazed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-after-icon\"></span></span></span>&nbsp;<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-text\" style=\"\"><a href=\"/wiki/Dazed_(Condition)\" title=\"Dazed (Condition)\">Dazes</a></span> nearby creatures. </dd>\n</dl><dl>\n<dt><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Allergy:_Gremishka_Spawn\" title=\"Magic Allergy: Gremishka Spawn\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/80px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Magic Allergy: Gremishka Spawn\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp/40px-Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/30/Generic_Utility_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Magic_Allergy:_Gremishka_Spawn\" title=\"Magic Allergy: Gremishka Spawn\">Magic Allergy: Gremishka Spawn</a> </dt>\n<dd>Burst into pieces. Two new gremishkas are born from your remains. </dd>\n</dl></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\">Notes</span></h2>\n<ul><li>At the start of the Gremishka's next turn, one of the granted <i>Magic Allergy</i> actions triggers at random.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Unsta